## OpenPlanr host-native workflows

Run `planr-spec`, `planr-plan`, and `planr-ship` as native Cursor agent workflows.
They inspect and modify the repository in the current session; they never launch
a second model-backed CLI process. Use `planr setup --runtime cursor --scope project`
to install the complete 24-skill rule package under `.cursor/rules/openplanr/`.
